  "notes": "8-gon rounded-rect body 0.180 x 0.050 x 0.018 m; twelve 5 x 5 mm keys raised 1.2 mm, a 38 x 38 mm plus-shaped direction cross, and a 20 x 22 mm sensor pocket 8 mm deep at the +X end.  Keys and cross are one merged tool -> one Exact union; the pocket is one difference.  The keys are square rather than round: 6-sided keys read the same at 512 px but push the mesh to 402 triangles, over the 320 budget.  Slots: grey body, yellow keys, metal direction cross, ink window (the pocket tool carries the ink material, so the cut faces are ink).",
